  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "This scene is set in the kitchen of Claude Monet from the second episode. Chef Viktor Barinov discovers that his favorite knife has disappeared, and he halts all work until someone finds it. Listen to the Russian story first, and then we will review the phrases together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А где мой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто взял мой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Шеф, я не брала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Повторяю. Кто взял мой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Я не знаю, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Никто отсюда домой не уйдёт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Пока вы не найдёте нож.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Понятно, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я не буду ничего готовить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Так, все ищем нож.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Живо!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "А что за проблема?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Мы такой же нож купим.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А ты знаешь, что это за нож?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's examine the chef's furious search line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А где мой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And where is my knife?' Chef Barinov suddenly notices his favorite tool is missing from its spot.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто взял мой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who took my knife?' He angrily questions the entire kitchen about the theft.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Шеф, я не брала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, I didn't take it.' Nastya quickly denies any involvement in the disappearance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Повторяю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I repeat.' Chef Barinov slowly grinds out a warning that he is losing patience.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто взял мой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who took my knife?' He shouts the question again to the terrified room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Я не знаю, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't know, chef.' Nastya nervously maintains her total ignorance of the situation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Никто отсюда домой не уйдёт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody will go home from here.' Chef Barinov dramatically holds the entire staff hostage.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Пока вы не найдёте нож.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Until you find the knife.' He sets an impossible condition for anyone leaving work today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Понятно, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood, chef.' Nastya meekly accepts the dictator's outrageous decree.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я не буду ничего готовить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will not cook anything.' Chef Barinov completely halts all food production in protest.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Так, все ищем нож.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, everyone, look for the knife.' He orders every single person to start hunting for his property.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Живо!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Quick!' Chef Barinov barks a short command to get them moving instantly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "А что за проблема?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the problem?' Nastya remains utterly confused about why this is such a catastrophe.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Мы такой же нож купим.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will buy the same knife.' She naively assumes a replacement can be easily purchased.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А ты знаешь, что это за нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And do you know what kind of knife this is?' Chef Barinov stares at her in disbelief at her profound ignorance. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
